# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 7 as ruled (round 3 ST: a gathered dynamic moves at n+1, an owed tick; at the build it reads the rows built above it), ch. 9 (a place's first value is read in its birth tick; an event answer is the next tick's input, owed; round 3 DY), ch. 8 (`<-` builds the child and binds its plain result) and ruling TC (places are counted as they are built): the plain part is 7, so the line builds its label at the child's place 1 and gives 1, and the last label is the child's place 2; as sem-ch09-host-late-bundle-plain-part from there.
test a_late_plain_part_is_taken

